      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "World Hopping is one of the number one activities groups engage in on this platform.\n\nGiving users the tools to collaborate on organizing these events in game would be massive. Many times, these lists are done in discords or people have to make portal worlds that involve navigating in world menus or walking absurdly long distances. Not to mention the development time to make a portal world like that.\n\nThis could be really useful to the Questies as well, who have limited ways of interacting with the game and wider internet.",
